      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAINTREE GAV (1) made light work of the tricky draw with a strong early sectional but swamped late when a close up fourth (28.95) at Sale over 510m. Worth another chance. BRONELLY TIMMY (2) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at Shepparton in a handy 25.89 beating Sky Springer. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. REGGAE MISS (6) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Shepparton over 450m behind Scott Greyscale (25.84) in a Grade 5. Has never missed the frame from six starts from this draw, including a win. Better than last start and can bounce back. OLYMPIA ONYX (5) took charge early and was never headed last time out. Hard to beat.",
